        "b": 755.7829409281768
      },
      "content": "Permissible maximum rpm of Spindle"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1189",
      "reading_order": 1527,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.620396,
        "t": 747.674768,
        "r": 541.4924880000004,
        "b": 687.8032529281769
      },
      "content": "The permissible maximum rpm of Spindle is maintained to more than 1/3 of the rated power in the chuck seizing power when the outside end has been placed inside of the circumference in the Chuck body. This time the maximum rpm of spindle depends on the maximum rpm of chuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1190",
      "reading_order": 1528,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.68051600000001,
        "t": 662.655068,
        "r": 267.33226200000007,
        "b": 653.7833489281769
      },
      "content": "Use the standard soft jaw."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1191",
      "reading_order": 1529,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.68051600000001,
        "t": 645.6751760000001,
        "r": 300.4593840000002,
        "b": 619.823564928177
      },
      "content": "Place the master jaw in the center of stroke."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1192",
      "reading_order": 1530,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.68051600000001,
        "t": 611.6552720000001,
        "r": 300.45637799999986,
        "b": 585.803660928177
      },
      "content": "Attach  the  soft  jaw  inside  of  the circumference in chuck."
    },
